id: pm-aaxq4n
title: "GH-1349: Bun 1.3.5 merge installer accepts a transient launcher"
description: Published 2026.9.29 under bunx --bun 1.3.5 reports merge install success but strict health sees all five driver commands drifted. The launcher selection falls back to a temporary Bun path when PATH has only a different Bun version.
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-29T14:58:58.446Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-29T19:51:19.452Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Packed CLI under Bun 1.3.5 installs a stable version-matched launcher; strict health passes after init and repeated merge install; a real Git merge executes the driver and preserves item/history integrity; mismatched or invalid runner hints fail safely; A directly invoked durable Bun binary outside PATH and without npm_execpath remains usable; Resolved bun-node temporary copies are refused
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: high
confidence: 85
expected_result: "Stable version-matched Bun driver from supported runner, PATH, or direct execution with disposable launcher refusal and preserved merge integrity"
actual_result: Relevant red phase confirmed. Stable direct launcher and disposable-copy refusal focused tests passed. Packed acceptance and full review revision validation are in progress
